    "updated_at": "2023-03-17T10:40:37Z",
    "body": "This isn't specific to dialog. Every time the HTML spec modifies attributes, it does so without linking to DOM. I suspect because most of it was written before DOM was.\r\n\r\nPersonally I think this is fine; I can't come up with any ambiguous reading. But if someone wants to fix this, that'd be nice!",
