    "created_at": "2023-03-17T11:06:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-17T11:06:53Z",
    "body": "The ambiguity I see is in adding an attribute of a given name to an element that already has an attribute of that name.\r\n\r\nI guess the intent is to '[set](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-attributes-set-value)' rather than 'add'.\r\n\r\nOther options would be to fail, or do what `el.append()` does, and remove the attribute node, and replace it with a new node, which changes equality and ordering of attribute nodes.",
